      <div class="phasebar-ticks" aria-hidden="true"><span>Month 0</span><span>~Month 3</span><span>Month 12&ndash;18</span></div>

      <div class="phasebar-summaries">
        <p><strong>~3 months.</strong> We build the strategy with a core team of 8&ndash;12 of your people.</p>
        <p><strong>Every week, to the finish.</strong> A one-hour review keeps every action moving until the mission is delivered.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="phasebar-panel" id="phase-1" hidden>
        <div class="phasebar-panel-inner">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>A core team of 8&ndash;12</strong> &mdash; the sweet spot for interdisciplinary work, however big the issue.</li>
            <li><strong>An executive sponsor</strong> &mdash; the owner, CEO or division head. Non-negotiable.</li>
            <li><strong>Input from across the organization</strong>, often hundreds of voices through targeted surveys.</li>
            <li><strong>HBDI throughout</strong>, giving the team a shared language from day one.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="phasebar-outcome"><span>You leave with</span> a complete strategy, built by your own team.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phasebar-panel" id="phase-2" hidden>
