          <ul>
            <li><strong>One hour, every week</strong> &mdash; a review of every active action.</li>
            <li><strong>An external facilitator</strong> asking the questions that keep accountability alive.</li>
            <li><strong>The &ldquo;sticky&rdquo; issues get solved</strong>, because someone asks about them every week.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="phasebar-outcome"><span>You leave with</span> the mission delivered &mdash; and a more aligned team.</div>
