{# ------------------------------------------------------- FIT CHECK --- #}
{# Directly after the comparison, so the CTA above leads straight here.
   Five questions; a readiness gauge and a "good to know" line update as you
   answer; early exit if it's a quick fix; a takeaway either way. #}
<section id="fit" class="fit2">
  <div class="wrap wrap--wide">
    <div class="fit2-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Fit check</div>
      <h2>Is Strategy as a Service a fit for you?</h2>
      <p>Five questions, one minute. An honest answer &mdash; and something to take home either way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fit2-board" data-fit2>
      <div class="fit2-main">
        <ol class="fit2-dots" aria-hidden="true"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol>

        <fieldset class="fit2-q" data-q="0">
          <legend><span class="fit2-qn">01</span>Picture your organization 18 months from now. What has changed?</legend>
          <div class="fit2-opts">
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="n95">We win more business &mdash; the commercial engine finally runs</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="n95">We sell something new &mdash; a new product, service or market</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="n95">We work differently &mdash; faster, with more ownership</button>
            <button type="button" data-exit="1">Honestly? We just need to fix one specific thing</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fit2-q" data-q="1" hidden>
          <legend><span class="fit2-qn">02</span>How long will that change really take?</legend>
          <div class="fit2-opts fit2-opts--3">
            <button type="button" data-exit="1">A few weeks</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="1" data-note="nMonths">A few months</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="nYear">A year or more</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fit2-q" data-q="2" hidden>
          <legend><span class="fit2-qn">03</span>When it gets hard in month four, who stands up for it?</legend>
          <div class="fit2-opts fit2-opts--3">
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="nSponsor">Our CEO or owner &mdash; visibly</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="1" data-note="nSponsor">A senior leader, if we make the case</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="0" data-flag="sponsor" data-note="nSponsor">Nobody yet</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fit2-q" data-q="3" hidden>
          <legend><span class="fit2-qn">04</span>Who would carry the work?</legend>
          <div class="fit2-opts fit2-opts--3">
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-note="nTeam">A cross-functional team of 8&ndash;12</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="1" data-note="nTeam">A handful of people</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="0" data-flag="team" data-note="nTeam">Mostly me</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fit2-q" data-q="4" hidden>
          <legend><span class="fit2-qn">05</span>Last time a big initiative stalled, what got in the way?</legend>
          <div class="fit2-opts">
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-take="tDaily" data-note="n600">The day-to-day took over</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-take="tOwner" data-note="n600">Nobody owned the follow-through</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-take="tBuyin" data-note="n600">People weren&rsquo;t really bought in</button>
            <button type="button" data-v="2" data-take="tNew" data-note="n600">We&rsquo;ve never really tried</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="fit2-result" data-fit2-result hidden aria-live="polite">
          <div class="fit2-tag" data-r-tag></div>
          <h3 data-r-title></h3>
          <p data-r-text></p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn-primary btn-primary--brass" href="{{ site.calendly }}" data-r-cta>Book a 20-minute call</a>
            <a class="btn-secondary" href="#" data-r-alt hidden></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fit2-exit" data-fit2-exit hidden aria-live="polite">
          <div class="fit2-tag fit2-tag--soft">Good news</div>
          <h3>You probably don&rsquo;t need a 12-month program.</h3>
          <p>Strategy as a Service is built for change that takes 12&ndash;18 months. For a focused, shorter challenge, one of these usually works better:</p>
          <div class="fit2-alts">
            <a href="/hbdi/"><strong>A team session</strong><span>One day with HBDI to get your team pulling the same way</span></a>
            <a href="/executive-coaching/"><strong>Executive coaching</strong><span>One-to-one, on the situation in front of you</span></a>
            <a href="/retreats/"><strong>A leadership retreat</strong><span>Step out of the day-to-day to see it clearly</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="fit2-exit-more">Not sure? <a href="{{ site.calendly }}">Tell us about it on a 20-minute call</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fit2-nav">
          <button class="fit2-back" type="button" data-fit2-back hidden>&larr; Back</button>
          <button class="fit2-restart" type="button" data-fit2-restart hidden>&#8635; Start over</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="fit2-side" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="fit2-gauge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="fit2-gauge-track"/>
            <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="fit2-gauge-fill" data-gauge/>
          </svg>
          <div class="fit2-gauge-num"><span data-gauge-num>0</span><small>%</small></div>
          <div class="fit2-gauge-label" data-gauge-label>Readiness</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fit2-note" data-note-box>
          <div class="fit2-note-k" data-note-k>Good to know</div>
          <p data-note-text>Most strategies don&rsquo;t fail on the idea. They fail in the follow-through.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

